ateastir.ca/articles/big-stuff-arts-club-ws\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Read more →</a></p>\n          \n        \n      \n        \n          \n          \n\n\n  \n    \n      <a href=\"https://www.createastir.ca/articles/shadbolt-centre-for-the-arts-meadows-of-stone-sc\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <p><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f10a7f0e4041a480cbbf0be/1790926310538-QGFTIDYOHJ4130EQ7F98/Brendan-Amy-Smiling-2.jpg\" alt=\"Shadbolt Centre for the Arts presents the new Canadian musical Meadows of Stone, November 7\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n\n  \n\n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    </p>\n  </a>\n\n    \n    \n\n    \n  \n\n\n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n              \n              <p>Set during the First World War, production draws inspiration from true events</p>\n            \n            \n            \n            <p><a href=\"https://www.createastir.ca/articles/shadbolt-centre-for-the-arts-meadows-of-stone-sc\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Read more →</a></p>\n          \n        \n      \n        \n          \n          \n\n\n  \n    \n      <a href=\"https://www.createastir.ca/articles/-the-effect-rumble-theatre-the-cultch\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <p><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5f10a7f0e4041a480cbbf0be/1791328628904-QUFIUYR6EHMFWVK9147G/TheEffect-Paige+Louter%2C+Andy+Kalirai%2C+Meghan+Gardiner+08-72ppi-Chelsey+Stuyt.jpg\" alt=\"After last year’s hit local debut, The Effect explores love and brain chemistry, at The Cultch October 15 to 25\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n\n  \n\n  \n\n    \n\n    \n\n    </p>\n  </a>\n\n    \n    \n\n    \n  \n\n\n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n  